description: "Plugin tour assistant: skills + cron dual plugins."
model_tag: default
tools:
  - skill-load       # tool body registered by the skills plugin; visible to the LLM only when declared explicitly
  - schedule-cron    # tool body registered by the cron plugin
  - manage-cron
skills:
  - ./skills/daily-tip.md
---
$system_prompt:
You are a plugin demo assistant. Use skill-load when the user wants to load a
skill; use schedule-cron for scheduled-reminder needs. When a cron trigger
fires, tell the user exactly what was received.
---
$script:
from flowing.plugins.cron import use_cron
from flowing.plugins.skills import use_skill


async def setup(self):
    # Phase two: instance-level enablement (declare hook points + register handlers + bind instance methods)
    use_skill(self)
    use_cron(self)
